fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"coretracers/leaks.html#GstLeaksTracer::log-live-objects","fragment":"\n\tlog-live-objects\n\nLogs all objects that are still alive to the debug log in the same format\nas the logging during gst_deinit.\nParameters:\nthe leaks tracer object to emit this signal on\n\n\tFlags:\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRun Last\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tAction\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\n"});